title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf repo init
catalog: CLI command
target: mf repo init
summary: Initialise a new repository and print its UUID

!! Reference

```
Initialise a new repository and print its UUID

Applies the `default` ignore preset to the new root (doc "Ignore presets"); use --ignore to pick a different preset set, or --no-ignore to leave the root's mf_ignore empty.

Usage: mf repo init [OPTIONS] <ROOT>

Arguments:
  <ROOT>
          

Options:
      --metafolder <METAFOLDER>
          External database location (instead of <root>/.metafolder)

      --name <NAME>
          Name of the repository (default: the root directory's name)

      --ignore <PRESETS>
          Ignore presets to apply to the new root (comma/space separated; default: "default")

      --no-ignore
          Leave the new root's mf_ignore set empty

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
```
